WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Matrix background in a fresh local Pocket session.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Open Calendar and send it to desktop 2.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Open Settings on desktop 1.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Open overview: desktop miniatures above, window previews below.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Select another preview with Tab and activate it with Enter.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Switch to desktop 3.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Press b twice to toggle the background. Visible glyphs remain after the first toggle.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Change the background to rain.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Change the background to snow.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Change the background to leaves.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Change the background to flowers.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Change the background to Flux.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Open the window previews over Flux.
